+// Absent disables Avalanche; null credentials creates an ephemeral observer
+// session. Credentials is an owned private regular nonsymlink file <=1MiB,
+// exact {schema:1,session_key:32-byte lowerhex,proof:V2 proof-envelope lowerhex,
+// delegation:ABC serialized delegation lowerhex}. Native defaults remain
+// unchanged: minimum stake1e12, dust1e10, maturity2016,8 inventory neighbors,
+// confidence128. Public proofs are persisted under the isolated node namespace;
+// session keys and delegation credentials are never saved to the peer store.
+// IBD is true on authority/recovery loss, pending headers/download/candidate
+// work, height below the explicit minimum, future tip, or tip older than the
+// explicit age. Thresholds do not manufacture peer/quorum/finality evidence.
+// status.avalanche reports actual driver readiness/quorum and tip finality.
 // stdout<=8MiB, nonblocking; output saturation terminates cleanly rather than
 // stalling peers.
 //
